Privacy Policy

One Dash is committed to protecting your privacy. This extension does not collect, store, or transmit any personal information or browsing data to external servers or third parties. All data, including tasks, resources, and history, is stored locally within your browser and remains under your control.

One Dash does not display advertisements, track user activity, or share information with outside organizations. Your privacy and security are our top priorities.

If you have any questions or concerns about privacy, please contact us through the support page.
